vel range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"druid-g907","druid-g170","druid-g951","druid-g908","druid-g863","druid-g874","druid-g79","druid-g872","druid-g875","druid-g906","druid-g96","druid-g943","druid-g946","druid-g941","druid-g249"}},{b="50-60",no="Best match per slot for Balance by stat priority, picked from dungeon drops, quest rewards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"druid-g1037","druid-g2","druid-g1106","druid-g234","druid-g1151","druid-g218","druid-g115","druid-g1153","druid-g1235","druid-g1048","druid-g1242","druid-g1077","druid-g1062","druid-g983","druid-g1021","druid-g1169","druid-g1222"}}},title="Balance | WoW Forever Druid Field Guide",nav={{id="overview",x=S[727]},{id="journey",x=S[594]},{id="talents",x=S[514]},{id="stats",x=S[622]},{id="combat",x=S[623]},{id="macros",x=S[641]},{id="dungeons",x=S[565]},{id="professions",x=S[595]},{id="crafting",x=S[579]},{id="questgear",x=S[556]},{id=S[507],x=S[671]}},asideNote=S[114],talentString="5032220115501351000000000000000000005253",ranks={{tree="Balance",name=S[688],r=5,max=5},{tree="Balance",name="Moonglow",r=3,max=3},{tree="Balance",name=S[898],r=2,max=2},{tree="Balance",name=S[557],r=2,max=2},{tree="Balance",name=S[689],r=2,max=2},{tree="Balance",name=S[642],r=1,max=1},{tree="Balance",name=S[879],r=1,max=1},{tree="Balance",name="Vengeance",r=5,max=5},{tree="Balance",name=S[899],r=5,max=5},{tree="Balance",name=S[944],r=1,max=1},{tree="Balance",name="Eclipse",r=3,max=3},{tree="Balance",name="Moonfury",r=5,max=5},{tree="Balance",name=S[880],r=1,max=1},{tree="Restoration",name=S[690],r=5,max=5},{tree="Restoration",name=S[535],r=2,max=5},{tree="Restoration",name="Naturalist",r=5,max=5},{tree="Restoration",name="Reflection",r=3,max=3}},order={{l1=10,l2=14,tree="Balance",name=S[688],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=15,l2=17,tree="Balance",name="Moonglow",r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=18,l2=19,tree="Balance",name=S[689],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=20,l2=21,tree="Balance",name=S[557],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=22,l2=22,tree="Balance",name=S[642],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=23,l2=24,tree="Balance",name=S[898],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=25,l2=25,tree="Balance",name=S[879],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=26,l2=30,tree="Balance",name="Vengeance",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=31,l2=31,tree="Balance",name=S[944],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=32,l2=34,tree="Balance",name="Eclipse",r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=35,l2=39,tree="Balance",name="Moonfury",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=40,l2=40,tree="Balance",name=S[880],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=41,l2=45,tree="Restoration",name=S[690],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=46,l2=48,tree="Restoration",name="Reflection",r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=49,l2=53,tree="Restoration",name="Naturalist",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=54,l2=58,tree="Balance",name=S[899],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=59,l2=60,tree="Restoration",name=S[535],r1=1,r2=2,max=5}},blocks={{t="anchor",id="overview"},{t="p",s="eyebrow",x=S[558]},{t="h1",x="Balance",sub=S[643]},{t="p",s="lede",x="Moonfire and Insect Swarm, then Wrath. Eclipse at 32–34 turns Wrath into faster Starfire casts, and Moonkin Form at 40 adds armor and a 3% critical-strike aura for your group."},{t="pills",list={S[772],"Suggested leveling build",S[596]}},{t="anchor",id="journey"},{t="kicker",x=S[728]},{t="h2",x=S[470]},{t="p",x="These stages follow the talent order below. The first levels are slow, and auto-attacking in Bear Form can match Wrath around level 10; leveling speeds up once spell power gear and Insect Swarm arrive."},{t="p",s="level",x="10–25 · Cheaper Wrath, longer reach"},{t="p",x="Improved Wrath 5/5 (10–14) cuts Wrath’s cast time by 0.5 seconds and its mana cost by 50%. Moonglow 3/3 (15–17) makes your spells cheaper, Nature’s Reach 2/2 (18–19) adds 20% range and 4% hit, which helps you tag enemies first in busy zones, Nature’s Majesty 2/2 (20–21) adds 4% critical strike, Nature’s Splendor at 22 lengthens Moonfire, Regrowth and Rejuvenation, then Improved Moonfire 2/2 (23–24) and Insect Swarm at 25."},{t="p",s="level",x="26–40 · Starfire and Moonkin Form"},{t="p",x="Vengeance 5/5 (26–30) doubles the critical-strike bonus of your Arcane and Nature spells, and Nature’s Grace at 31 speeds up your next cast after a critical strike. Eclipse 3/3 (32–34) makes each Wrath shorten your next two Starfires by 0.5 seconds (up to four charges); before Eclipse, you can ignore Starfire. Moonfury 5/5 (35–39) adds 10% Arcane and Nature damage, and Moonkin Form arrives at 40."},{t="p",s="level",x="41–60 · Pushback, damage and mana"},{t="p",x="Nature’s Focus 5/5 (41–45) protects casts from pushback, Reflection 3/3 (46–48) lets part of your mana regeneration continue while casting, Naturalist 5/5 (49–53) raises all damage by 10%, Improved Starfire 5/5 (54–58) shortens Starfire by 0.5 seconds, and Heart of the Wild 2/5 (59–60) finishes the build."},{t="anchor",id="talents"},{t="kicker",x=S[515]},{t="h2",x=S[772]},{t="p",x=S[81]},{t="widget",w="talents"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[566]},{t="widget",w="ranks"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[502]},{t="p",x=S[145]},{t="widget",w="order"},{t="p",s="notice",x="Moonkin Form’s critical strike aura does not stack with a Feral Druid’s Leader of the Pack. Moonkin Form prevents healing spells: shift out to cast Rejuvenation or Regrowth."},{t="anchor",id="stats"},{t="kicker",x=S[624]},{t="h2",x=S[541]},{t="p",x="Balance wants hit until the cap, then critical strike and spell power. Weapon damage does nothing for your spells."},{t="h3",x=S[691]},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[972],x="Nature and Arcane damage count too"},{t="stat",i=2,b="Intellect",x="mana pool"},{t="stat",i=3,b="Stamina",x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Spirit",x="faster drinking between pulls"},{t="p",s="small",x="Staves with spell damage and Intellect are your main upgrades while leveling."},{t="h3",x="At level 60"},{t="stat",i=1,b="Hit chance",x="to 17%"},{t="stat",i=2,b=S[928],x=""},{t="stat",i=3,b="Spell power",x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Intellect",x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Some estimates put spell power above crit, with spell penetration and haste as extras."},{t="p",s="notice",x="Spell hit cap: 17% against raid bosses (level 63), 4% against enemies of your own level. The level 60 list is an early estimate: the beta stopped at level 30, so expect changes once endgame gear is known. A big upgrade in a lower stat can still beat a small one in a higher stat."},{t="anchor",id="combat"},{t="kicker",x=S[542]},{t="h2",x=S[580]},{t="p",x="Treat this as a priority list, not a fixed loop. Insect Swarm arrives at 25, Eclipse at 31, Moonkin Form and Hurricane at 40 in this order."},{t="h4",x=S[929]},{t="p",x="Keep Mark of the Wild and Thorns on yourself, and cast Rejuvenation on yourself before you engage. Open with Moonfire in crowded areas so you tag the enemy instantly, and with Wrath otherwise."},{t="h4",x="Damage over time"},{t="p",x="Keep Moonfire and, from 25, Insect Swarm on enemies that will live long enough for them to tick. Spread both to every enemy in an add pull."},{t="h4",x="Filler"},{t="p",x="Wrath is your filler. With 3/3 Eclipse, cast one Wrath and then two faster Starfires."},{t="h4",x="Staying alive"},{t="p",x="Regrowth mid-fight if you need it; one Rejuvenation and one Regrowth are usually enough. Nature’s Grasp and Entangling Roots keep an extra enemy away; leave Moonkin Form to heal."},{t="h4",x="Several enemies"},{t="p",x="From 40, Hurricane on three or more enemies, ideally with Barkskin so pushback does not cancel it. Before 40, apply your damage over time effects and Wrath one target at a time."},{t="h4",x="Mana"},{t="p",x="Carry several stacks of water and drink after every few enemies. Innervate at 40 restores mana; Omen of Clarity at 20 makes a spell free now and then (Wrath does not consume it)."},{t="abil",names={"Wrath","Moonfire",S[879],"Starfire","Hurricane","Entangling Roots","Nature's Grasp",S[973],"Regrowth",S[880],"Barkskin","Innervate"}},{t="h3",x=S[614]},{t="p",x="Stats for Balance: spell power first, then Intellect, critical strike, haste (rare), Spirit and mana per 5. Weapon damage does not raise your spells."},{t="p",x="Staff path: Golemheart Stave (Hall of Thanes, 13), Emberstone Staff (Deadmines, 17), Crescent Staff (Wailing Caverns quest, 22), Glimmering Staff (Enchanting 140, 25), Illusionary Rod (Scarlet Monastery, 34), Greatstaff of the Necrokhans (Desolace quest, 42) and Radiant Staff (Enchanting 220, 45)."},{t="h3",x=S[543]},{t="p",x=S[74]},{t="p",x=S[109]},{t="anchor",id="macros"},{t="kicker",x=S[644]},{t="h2",x=S[455]},{t="p",x=S[76]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[62]},{t="macro",n=S[581],x=S[224],code=S[213]},{t="macro",n=S[625],x=S[230],code=S[232]},{t="macro",n=S[582],x=S[227],code=S[214]},{t="macro",n=S[597],x=S[225],code=S[222]},{t="macro",n=S[615],x=S[231],code=S[258]},{t="macro",n=S[464],x=S[154],code=S[142]},{t="macro",n=S[492],x=S[173],code=S[393]},{t="macro",n=S[583],x=S[223],code=S[255]},{t="macro",n=S[616],x=S[238],code=S[351]},{t="macro",n="Hurricane at your cursor",x="Leaves form and places Hurricane at your cursor without a second click. Learned at 40.",code="#showtooltip Hurricane\n/cancelform\n/cast [@cursor] Hurricane"},{t="macro",n="Mouseover Entangling Roots",x="Leaves form and roots the enemy under your pointer or your target. Damage can break the roots.",code="#showtooltip Entangling Roots\n/cancelform\n/cast [@mouseover,harm,nodead][harm,nodead] Entangling Roots"},{t="macro",n="Mouseover Moonfire",x="Applies Moonfire to the enemy under your pointer, otherwise your target, so you can spread it in add pulls. Not tested in game.",code="#showtooltip Moonfire\n/cast [@mouseover,harm,nodead][harm,nodead] Moonfire"},{t="macro",n="Mouseover Insect Swarm",x="Applies Insect Swarm (talent, 25) to the enemy under your pointer, otherwise your target. Not tested in game.",code="#showtooltip Insect Swarm\n/cast [@mouseover,harm,nodead][harm,nodead] Insect Swarm"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[318]},{t="anchor",id="dungeons"},{t="kicker",x=S[672]},{t="h2",x=S[503]},{t="p",x=S[93]},{t="widget",w="rarity"},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[94]},{t="p",s="notice",x="Balance loot selection · 1 November 2026. Cloth and leather with spell damage, Intellect and Spirit, staves, one-handed maces and daggers with held off-hand items, and caster jewelry. Healing-only bonuses, Fire, Frost, Shadow and Holy bonuses, mail, plate, shields, swords, axes, wands and ranged weapons are left out."},{t="widget",w="loot"},{t="anchor",id="professions"},{t="kicker",x=S[544]},{t="h2",x=S[493]},{t="p",x=S[106]},{t="widget",w="prof"},{t="anchor",id="crafting"},{t="kicker",x=S[567]},{t="h2",x=S[471]},{t="p",x="These are items to compare, not a mandatory shopping list. Brackets are 1–9, 10–19, 20–29, 30–39, 40–49, 50–59 and level 60. They use the item’s equip/use requirement, not crafting skill; items with no level requirement are placed by item level. Druids wear cloth and leather and use staves, maces, daggers, fist weapons and polearms (train polearms at a weapon master); this page shows only the pieces that suit Balance. Unknown item requirements remain separate. A published recipe does not establish that its trainer, materials or final acquisition path are available in the beta."},{t="widget",w="craft"},{t="anchor",id="questgear"},{t="kicker",x=S[545]},{t="h2",x=S[444]},{t="p",x=S[39]},{t="widget",w="quest"},{t="anchor",id=S[507]},{t="kicker",x=S[673]},{t="h2",x="Your notes"},{t="widget",w="notes"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[123]}}},{id="feral-cat",name="Feral (Cat)",token="CAT",gearBrackets={{b="Quest rewards",no="Quest rewards that fit this spec's stat priority, sorted by quest level. The tooltip names the quest, its level, the quest giver and the faction. Quest level is not the minimum pickup level.",keys={"st-druid-1","druid-g125","druid-g136","druid-g38","druid-g42","druid-g90","druid-g240","druid-g327","druid-g58","druid-g283","druid-g57","druid-g68","druid-g34","druid-g187","druid-g1","druid-g14","druid-g37","druid-g252","druid-g20","druid-g24","druid-g59","druid-g67","druid-g72","druid-g226","druid-g291","druid-g154","druid-g